{"id":"be_ne_fice","lemma":"bénéfice","pos":"noun","rank":4064,"glosses":["profit, earning","benefit, advantage"],"ipa":"/be.ne.fis/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/51/Fr-b%C3%A9n%C3%A9fice.ogg/Fr-b%C3%A9n%C3%A9fice.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"bénéfices"},"formAudio":{"bénéfices":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-b%C3%A9n%C3%A9fices.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Donne-lui le bénéfice du doute.","en":"Give him the benefit of the doubt.","words":[{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"doubt"}]},{"text":"Il a réclamé sa part des bénéfices.","en":"He claimed his share of the profits.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to protest","l":"réclamer"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"share"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Que pouvons-nous faire pour augmenter nos bénéfices ?","en":"What can we do to increase our profits?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to increase"},{"g":"our","l":"notre"},null]},{"text":"Accordez-lui le bénéfice du doute.","en":"Give him the benefit of the doubt.","words":[{"g":"to grant","l":"accorder"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"doubt"}]},{"text":"L'entreprise ne réalisait pas de bénéfices.","en":"The business didn't produce a profit.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"company, business"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to direct","l":"réaliser"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}